                    <div class="admin-eyebrow">PLATFORM MANAGEMENT</div>
                    <h1><i class="fas fa-shield-halved"></i> Admin Control Center</h1>
                    <p>Manage users, plans, payments, announcements, domains, links, backups and platform activity.</p>
